"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-1021.8093872070312, 1884.867431640625], "id": 1, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"weight_dtype": true, "unet_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [5, 23], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["A cosmic-scale masterpiece of Multiverse Overlap: The Convergence of Realities. A terrifyingly grand visual of multiple universes colliding at a single singularity. The composition is a chaotic yet divine collage of competing realities: massive, hyper-precise Dyson-sphere-like mechanical structures (Order) interlacing with swirling, organic, bio-luminescent nebulae and ancient biological ruins (Chaos); both are being pierced by glowing, non-Euclidean geometric fractals and mathematical dimensions (Logic). The boundaries between realities are depicted as violent, shimmering 'reality fractures' with glitch effects and quantum disintegration. Intense lighting conflict: cold cyan mechanical pulses, warm organic magmas, and ethereal violet dimensional rays clashing. Extreme depth of field, massive scale, cosmic scale, 8K, hyper-detailed, ray-tracing, surreal and overwhelming grandeur, cinematic masterpiece. --ar 21:9 --stylize 1000 --v 6.0"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 3, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 78, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [418.8157958984375, 376.8684997558594], "pos": [-342.7367858886719, 1896.86767578125], "id": 4, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {